# BetTracker — Complete Architecture & Implementation Plan

> Professional betting analytics platform — full rebuild from scratch with web (Next.js) and mobile (React Native/Expo) channels.

---

## 1. Technology Stack

### Chosen Stack with Justifications

| Layer | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| **Monorepo** | **Turborepo + pnpm** | Fastest monorepo tool, native caching, minimal config vs Nx. pnpm for disk-efficient hoisting. |
| **Web Frontend** | **Next.js 15** (App Router) | SSR/SSG for SEO on landing + share pages, server components for DB queries, middleware for auth, built-in image optimization. |
| **Mobile** | **React Native + Expo** (SDK 52) | Shares TypeScript + core logic with web. Expo simplifies build/deploy without Xcode config pain. |
| **Backend/DB** | **Supabase** (Postgres 15 + Auth + Edge Functions + Realtime) | Stays consistent with your prior experience, RLS for multi-tenancy, built-in auth, zero cost for personal use. |
| **ORM** | **Drizzle ORM** | Type-safe SQL, zero overhead, migrations from schema, works on Edge/Serverless. Better DX than raw Supabase client for complex queries. |
| **Charting** | **Recharts** (web) + **Victory Native** (mobile) | Recharts: proven in your existing app, SSR-compatible. Victory Native: purpose-built for RN with Skia rendering. |
| **State** | **Zustand** + **TanStack Query v5** | Zustand for UI state (theme, profile selection). TanStack Query for server state (caching, pagination, refetching). |
| **Styling** | **Tailwind CSS v4** (web) + **NativeWind v4** (mobile) | Utility-first with design tokens, dark mode via `dark:` prefix, shared theme config between platforms. You explicitly allowed Tailwind. |
| **Validation** | **Zod** | Runtime + compile-time type safety, composable schemas, Drizzle integration. |
| **i18n** | **next-intl** (web) + **i18next** (mobile) | next-intl: App Router native. i18next: React Native standard. Shared JSON translation files. |
| **Testing** | **Vitest** + **React Testing Library** + **Playwright** | Vitest for unit/integration. Playwright for E2E browser tests. RTL for component tests. |
| **CI/CD** | **GitHub Actions** | Free for public repos, Vercel deploy on push, type-check + lint + test gates. |
| **Error Tracking** | **Sentry** (free tier) | Both web and RN SDKs, source maps, session replay. |
| **Analytics** | **Vercel Analytics** + **PostHog** (optional) | Vercel: zero-config web vitals. PostHog: privacy-friendly product analytics. |

### Packages & Dependencies (key ones)

```
# Core shared
zod, drizzle-orm, date-fns, papaparse

# Web
next@15, react@19, tailwindcss@4, recharts, @tanstack/react-query,
zustand, next-intl, @supabase/ssr, html2canvas, jspdf, qrcode.react,
lucide-react, framer-motion

# Mobile
expo@~52, react-native, nativewind@4, victory-native, @shopify/react-native-skia,
expo-router, @supabase/supabase-js, expo-secure-store

# Dev
turborepo, typescript@5.7, vitest, @testing-library/react,
playwright, eslint, prettier, drizzle-kit, @sentry/nextjs
```

