### Component Variants (Design System)

All design tokens are defined in `packages/ui/src/tokens/` as plain TypeScript objects (no React dependency). Both web and mobile consume these tokens.

Key components built in `apps/web/src/components/`:
- `StatCard` — hero + compact variants, 5 color types
- `ChartCard` — container with title, subtitle, export button
- `DataTable` — sortable columns, filters, pagination, empty state
- `Badge` — semantic colors (success, danger, warning, info)
- `Button` — primary, secondary, ghost, danger; sizes sm/md/lg
- `Input` — text, password (toggle), date, file; with validation states
- `Modal` — portal-based, animated, keyboard trap, close on Escape
- `Dropdown` — portal-rendered, auto-positioning
- `Sidebar` — collapsible navigation with icons and active state
- `Skeleton` — shimmer loaders per component type
- `Toast` — notification system with types and auto-dismiss

