## 8. Phased Development Roadmap

### Phase 0 — Foundation (~2-3 sessions)

| Step | Details |
|---|---|
| 1 | Initialize monorepo with `turbo init`, pnpm workspaces |
| 2 | Create `packages/config` with shared tsconfig, eslint, prettier |
| 3 | Create `packages/core` with types, validators (Zod), formatters |
| 4 | Create `packages/database` with Drizzle schema + initial migration |
| 5 | Initialize Next.js 15 app in `apps/web` with Tailwind v4 |
| 6 | Setup Supabase project: apply migration, enable RLS, configure Auth |
| 7 | Implement Auth pages (login, register, reset) with full validation |
| 8 | Build app layout shell (sidebar, header, responsive) |
| 9 | Design system tokens + key base components |
| 10 | Landing page (public, SEO-optimized) |
| 11 | GitHub repo with README, LICENSE, .gitignore, CI workflow |

