## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Supabase Project**: Do you have an existing Supabase project you want to reuse, or should I create configuration for a new one? I'll need the project URL and anon key as environment variables.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Tailwind CSS v4**: You mentioned being open to Tailwind. I've chosen v4 (latest, CSS-first config). It differs significantly from v3 — no `tailwind.config.js`, configuration via CSS `@theme`. Are you comfortable with this, or would you prefer v3 for stability?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Drizzle ORM vs Raw Supabase Client**: I propose Drizzle for type-safe queries + migration management. This adds a build step for schema generation but gives much better type safety. The alternative is using the Supabase JS client directly (closer to your existing code). Which do you prefer?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Mobile Priority**: Phase 6 (mobile) is last. If you want the iPhone app developed earlier or in parallel, I can restructure the plan. What's your priority?

> [!IMPORTANT]  
> **Domain/Deployment**: Do you have a domain name for this project? The web app will deploy to Vercel. I'll need to know if you want a custom domain configured.

